1
00:06:42,000 --> 00:06:48,000
There are no heroes. Only rebels.

2
00:13:24,000 --> 00:13:30,000
Rebel Moon - Part One: A Child of Fire is a science fiction,
action, adventure film directed by Zack Snyder.

3
00:20:06,000 --> 00:20:12,000
When the ruthless forces of the Motherworld threaten a quiet farming village on a
distant moon, a mysterious outsider becomes its best hope for survival.

4
00:26:48,000 --> 00:26:54,000
Kora, played by Sofia Boutella.

5
00:33:30,000 --> 00:33:36,000
Gunnar, played by Michiel Huisman.

6
00:40:12,000 --> 00:40:18,000
Atticus Noble, played by Ed Skrein.

7
00:46:54,000 --> 00:47:00,000
Titus, played by Djimon Hounsou.

8
00:53:36,000 --> 00:53:42,000
Nemesis, played by Bae Doona.

9
01:00:18,000 --> 01:00:24,000
Tarak, played by Staz Nair.

10
01:07:00,000 --> 01:07:06,000
Rebel Moon – Part One: A Child of Fire, or simply Rebel Moon, is a 2023 American epic space opera film
directed by Zack Snyder from a screenplay he co-wrote with Kurt Johnstad and Shay Hatten.

11
01:13:42,000 --> 01:13:48,000
Its ensemble cast features Sofia Boutella, Djimon Hounsou, Ed Skrein, Michiel
Huisman, Bae Doona, Ray Fisher, Charlie Hunnam, and Anthony Hopkins.

12
01:20:24,000 --> 01:20:30,000
The film is set in a fictional galaxy ruled by the imperialistic Motherworld,
whose military, the Imperium, threatens a village on the moon Veldt.

13
01:27:06,000 --> 01:27:12,000
Kora, a former Imperium soldier, ventures on a quest to recruit warriors from across the
galaxy to make a stand against the Imperium before they return to Veldt.

14
01:33:48,000 --> 01:33:54,000
Following a limited theatrical release on December 15, 2023,
Rebel Moon was released by Netflix on December 22.

15
01:40:30,000 --> 01:40:36,000
It received generally negative reviews from critics.

16
01:47:12,000 --> 01:47:18,000
A sequel, Rebel Moon – Part Two: The Scargiver, released on April 19, 2024.

17
01:53:54,000 --> 01:54:00,000
An R-rated director's cut, titled Rebel Moon – Chapter One:
Chalice of Blood, was released on August 2, 2024.

18
02:00:36,000 --> 02:00:42,000
The film explores themes of rebellion, space war,
space, female protagonist, militarism.

19
02:07:18,000 --> 02:07:24,000
The tone is thought_provoking.
